  "description": "Creation of an outdoor seating area with balustrade enclosure to the front of the restaurant with alterations to two of the six front panels to existing shopfront.",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed outdoor enclosure due to its position, size, and external appearance would be an intrusive and inappropriate development, out of scale and character in this Conservation Area, failing to maintain and/or enhance the appearance and character of this Conservation Area contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1, CC2 and CC4, London Plan Policies of D4, HC1 and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed balustrade enclosure would result in an obstruction to the public highway, would require an extinguishment of a public right of way, would be detrimental to the pedestrian movement, opportunities for walking, public realm and health and well-being, which is contrary to Local Plan Policy EC2, London Plan Policy T2 and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework."
